    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoon Iyo Deliilaah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu Samsoon tegey Gaasa, oo halkaas wuxuu ku arkay dhillo, wuuna u galay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa dadkii reer Gaasa lagu yidhi, Samsoon halkanuu yimid. Oo intay hareereeyeen ayay habeenkii oo dhan magaalada iriddeeda ku gaadayeen, oo habeenkaas oo dhanna way aamusnaayeen, oo waxay yidhaahdeen, Markuu waagu beryo ayaynu dili doonnaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Samsoonna ilaa habeenbadhkii ayuu jiifay, oo wuxuu kacay habeenbadhkii, oo gacanta ku qabsaday albaabbadii magaalada iriddeeda iyo labadii tiir, markaasuu fujiyey dhammaantood iyo qataarkiiba, oo garbahuu saaray, oo wuxuu la tegey buurta Xebroon ku hor taal dusheeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabadeedna wuxuu jeclaaday naag joogta dooxadii Soreq, oo magaceedana la odhan jiray Deliilaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo amiirradii reer Falastiin ayaa u yimid iyadii, oo waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Bal sasab isaga oo soo ogow meesha xooggiisa weynu kaga jiro, iyo sida aannu kaga adkaan karno, oo aannu intaannu xidhno u saxariirin karno; oo midkayo kastaaba wuxuu ku siin doonaa kun iyo boqol xabbadood oo lacag ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Deliilaah Samsoon ku tidhi, Waan ku baryayaaye ii sheeg meesha xooggaaga weynu kaaga jiro, oo maxaa lagugu xidhi karaa si laguu saxariiriyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Samsoonna wuxuu iyadii ku yidhi, Haddii laygu xidho toddoba xadhig oo qoyan oo aan weligood engegin, markaasaan taag yaraanayaa, oo waxaan noqonayaa sida dadka kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay amiirradii reer Falastiin iyadii u keeneen toddoba xadhig oo qoyan oo aan engegin, oo iyana isagii bay ku xidhay xadhkihii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba waxay haysatay niman gaadmo ah oo joogay qolka hoose. Oo waxay isagii ku tidhi, Samsoonow, reer Falastiin way ku hayaan. Oo xadhkihiina wuxuu u jaray sidii shootali dab la saaray u go'o oo kale. Taas darteed xooggiisii meeluu ku jiro lama ogaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Deliilaah Samsoon ku tidhi, Bal eeg, waad igu majaajilootaye. Oo been baad ii sheegtay, haddaba waan ku baryayaaye, ii sheeg waxa lagugu xidhi karo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu ku yidhi, Haddii laygu xidho xadhko cuscusub oo aan lagu shaqayn, markaas waan taag yaraanayaa, oo waxaan noqonayaa sida dadka kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Deliilaah qaadday xadhko cuscusub oo ku xidhay isagii, oo waxay ku tidhi, Samsoonow, reer Falastiin way ku hayaan. Nimankii gaadmadii ahaana waxay ku jireen qolka hoose. Markaasuu xadhkihii gacmihiisa uga jaray sida dunta oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Deliilaah Samsoon ku tidhi, Haddaba tan iyo markii hore waad igu majaajilootay, oo been baad ii sheegtay. Ii sheeg waxa lagugu xidhi karo. Kolkaasuu ku yidhi, Toddobada raamood ee madaxayga haddaad dharsameeye duntiis kula tidicdid waan taag yaraanayaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay qodob ku qodobtay oo ku tidhi, Samsoonow, reer Falastiin waa ku hayaan. Oo intuu hurdadii ka soo toosay ayuu rujiyey qodobkii iyo looxii dunta, iyo duntii dharsameeyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay isagii ku tidhi, Sidee baad u odhan kartaa, Waan ku jeclahay, adigoo aanu qalbigaagu ila jirin? Bal eeg, saddex jeer baad igu majaajilootay oo iimana aad sheegin meesha xooggaaga weynu ku jiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay maalin walba hadalkeedii ku sii cadaadisay, oo ay ku adkaysay, ayaa naftiisii cidhiidhi gashay ilaa dhimasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasuu u sheegay wixii qalbigiisa ku jiray oo dhan oo ku yidhi, Madaxayga mandiil lama marin, waayo, tan iyo markaan dhashay waxaan ahaa Nadiir Ilaah loo soocay. Haddii la ii xiiro, xooggaygu waa iga tegayaa, oo waan taag yaraanayaa, oo waxaan noqonayaa sida dadka kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deliilaahna markay ogaatay inuu u wada sheegay wixii qalbigiisa ku jiray oo dhan ayay u cid dirtay oo u yeedhay amiirradii reer Falastiin, oo waxay ku tidhi, Bal markan ii kaalaya, waayo, wixii qalbigiisa ku jiray oo dhan wuu ii sheegay. Markaasay amiirradii reer Falastiin iyadii u yimaadeen oo lacagtiina gacantooday ugu soo qaadeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay intay isagii ku seexisay jilbaheedii, ayay nin u yeedhatay, oo waxay ka xiirtay toddobadii raamood ee madaxiisa, dabadeedna waxay bilowday inay saxariiriso, oo xooggiisiina waa ka tegey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay ku tidhi, Samsoonow, reer Falastiin waa ku hayaan. Kolkaasuu hurdadiisii ka soo toosay, oo wuxuu yidhi, Sidii mararkii kale ayaan bixi doonaa oo isgilgili doonaa. Laakiinse isma uu ogayn in Rabbigu ka tegey isaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay reer Falastiin isagii qabteen, indhihiisiina way ka rideen, kolkaasay isagii keeneen Gaasa, oo waxay ku xidheen silsilado naxaas ah; oo isna wax buu ku ridqi jiray xabsiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee timihii madaxiisu waxay bilaabeen inay soo baxaan kolkii la xiiray dabadeed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dhimashadii Samsoon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay amiirradii reer Falastiin isu soo urursadeen inay allabari weyn u bixiyaan ilaahood oo ahaa Daagoon, iyo inay reyreeyaan; waayo, waxay isku yidhaahdeen, Cadowgeennii Samsoon ahaa waxaa gacanteenna soo geliyey ilaaheen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkiina markay isagii arkeen ayay ilaahood ammaaneen; waayo, waxay yidhaahdeen, Ilaaheen wuxuu gacanteenna soo geliyey kii ahaa cadowgeennii iyo kii dalkeenna baabbi'in jiray oo layn jiray kuwo badan oo inaga mid ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii qalbigoodii farxay ayay yidhaahdeen, Samsoon u yeedha ha noo cayaaree. Markaasay Samsoon xabsigii uga yeedheen, oo hortooduu ku cayaaray. Kolkaasay waxay isagii taageen tiirarkii dhexdooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu Samsoon ku yidhi yarkii hagayay, Bal i daa aan taabtee tiirarka gurigu ku taagan yahaye, oo aan ku tiirsadee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo gurigana waxaa ka buuxay rag iyo dumarba, oo amiirradii reer Falastiin oo dhammuna halkaasay wada joogeen; saqafkana waxaa dul joogay dad ku dhow saddex kun oo rag iyo dumarba leh, oo daawanayay intuu Samsoon cayaarayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu Samsoon Rabbiga baryay, oo yidhi, Sayidow, Rabbiyow, waan ku baryayaaye, i xusuuso, oo waan ku tuugayaaye, markan keliya xoog ii yeel, Ilaahow, si aan reer Falastiin haddiiba uga magdhowdo labadaydii indhood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.28",
